### Go template
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

.idea
.idea/*

*.xml

*_local.go
*_local.toml
configs/config.dev.toml
configs/config.test.toml
configs/config.prod.toml

vendor/*

*.log

static/avatars/*

static/files/*

web/chat-server/src/assets/cert/*

internal/service/kafka/start.bat

*.sh

*.ext

/.env
cmd/**/logs
cmd/**/*_backend

# 调试 / 工具产物
tmp/
web/chat-server/.codex-preview/

# 运行/压测日志(根目录积压 130MB+ 调试产物,整体忽略)
logs/

# 根目录学习/辅助文档与外部参考快照(不属于项目代码,防止误提交)
/MISSION.md
/NOTES.md
/PROJECT_LEARNING_PLAN.md
/RESOURCES.md
/reference/

# 面试/简历备考材料(本地保留,不进入公开仓库)
/docs/notes/面试题库.md
/docs/notes/简历条目.md
/docs/notes/简历最终版.md
